## ⚠️ Common Pitfalls & Debugging

1. **Body Parsing Invalidation:** If you use Express-style body parsers or call `req.json()` before `stripe.webhooks.constructEvent()`, signature verification will fail 100% of the time.
2. **Local vs Cloud Webhook Secret Mismatch:** The webhook secret from `stripe listen` (`whsec_...`) changes every time you log in or run from a different machine. Ensure your `.env` matches the running CLI instance.
3. **Clock Skew Tolerance Zone:** Stripe rejects payloads where the timestamp header deviates by more than 5 minutes from system time. Ensure your development OS clock is synchronized.

