## ⚠️ Common Pitfalls & Debugging

1. **Redis String Encoding Corruption:** Never use standard Redis string commands (`redis.get()`, `redis.set()`) for binary Yjs updates. Strings corrupt binary buffers. Always use `redis.getBuffer()` and `redis.set(key, Buffer.from(...))`.
