### Step 2 · Exponential Backoff with Full Jitter Implementation

Create `frontend/utils/backoff.ts`:

```typescript
export class BackoffManager {
  private attempt = 0;

  constructor(
    private baseMs = 1000,
    private capMs = 15000
  ) {}

  public getNextDelay(): number {
    // Full Jitter formula
    const maxDelay = Math.min(this.capMs, this.baseMs * Math.pow(2, this.attempt));
    const delayWithJitter = Math.floor(Math.random() * maxDelay);
    this.attempt++;
    return delayWithJitter;
  }

  public reset(): void {
    this.attempt = 0;
  }

  public getAttempt(): number {
    return this.attempt;
  }
}
```

